    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c57ad4e80e1fad8c714d13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，即便如此――我还是从那个人那里\n学会了应该昂首向前，坚持到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d48be3e0bad68381ec7c8ec6b7fa3abf62d6ac1fc83b1a3fd71b34acbfced94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
