    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e016e70a855a5206c6570c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主题正如封面上写的标题。\n『空中救世主在秋华赏中必胜的依据』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e9ad9dd83ba842e5700fa6e499f7d33ccfc280a668d9e871e2ffaead478836f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50287c80d458ca42ab5a605b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要论证这个主题是否成立，\n我手头有堆积如山的数据可以作为基础。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a3e35565e400f6dcb0c2bccb1936e3158ae35e6ccd8498d1cb4a2de9e5c3fa1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
