    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b42ff9fd88286c75f5f94c56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们曾一起反复商量，一次次更新。\nold文件夹里，按编号保存着\n数也数不清的脚步痕迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "327fc0e588e4f13bd13d734e7511301b0149c1c3b939dde9d33a30aceed42a27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bc94505269428624c7d3c0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一次交谈，也和今天一样，\n是在天气晴朗的清晨海边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef15cc22d1faf6962f5387107c16c304cc77a0058ab50b2137ce3929012bcdff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8669d2e10931fe6db84b2184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，要多少依据都能拿出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85989d6a0b3e14696be6776ed3003481d3200a8acc3560440dfe890f42e32998",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111115.json",
      "json_path": [
